{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0075","paragraphs":[{"id":"p54b32a85b39b-1","text":"兰芷满芳洲，游思横路。"},{"id":"p9a95fc861454-1","text":"罗袜尘生步。"},{"id":"p183718305c74-1","text":"迎顾。"},{"id":"p140f74fbb2aa-1","text":"整鬟颦黛，脉脉两情难语。"},{"id":"p6367bd1c3422-1","text":"细风吹柳絮。"},{"id":"pf920af30597e-1","text":"人南渡。"},{"id":"p1c4d150b49b7-1","text":"回首旧游，山无重数。"},{"id":"p599ccdb50d9e-1","text":"花底深朱户。"},{"id":"p5ff1b38252df-1","text":"何处。"},{"id":"pe7952d29c8a2-1","text":"半黄梅子，向晚一帘疏雨。"},{"id":"p2b6bf4824261-1","text":"断魂分付与。"},{"id":"p81d51e07590d-1","text":"春将去。"}]}